    "title": "Terminal Master - Bus Tycoon",
    "description": "<b>Terminal Master-Bus Tycoon: Your Ultimate Transportation Empire Adventure!</b>\r\n\r\nWelcome to Terminal Master-Bus Tycoon, the ultimate arcade idle game for all transportation tycoon gamers! Dive into an addictive and unique experience where you get to build, manage, and expand your very own bus terminal empire. Whether you're a fan of idle games, simulation games, or just love managing a business, this game has everything you need to keep you entertained for hours.\r\n\r\n<b>Key Features:</b>\r\n\r\n<b>1. Launch New Bus Terminal Establishments</b>\ud83d\ude8c\r\nStart small and grow big! Launch new bus terminals across various locations and connect different parts of the country. Ensure your terminals are the best in the business by providing top-notch services and amenities for your passengers.\r\n<b>2. Clean Up the Buses</b>\ud83e\uddf9\r\nKeep your buses spotless and hygienic. Manage a team to clean up trash, restock restroom supplies, and ensure your buses are always ready for the next trip. Clean buses mean happy passengers!\r\n<b>3. Manage Passengers Efficiently</b>\ud83e\uddf3\r\nOversee the flow of passengers as they get on various buses heading to numerous destinations. Make sure everyone gets to where they need to go, on time and with a smile on their face.\r\n<b>4. Upgrade Your Buses</b>\ud83d\ude80\r\nInvest your hard-earned cash to upgrade your fleet. Better buses mean more passengers, more money, and a more extensive transportation empire. From standard upgrades to luxury VIP options, ensure your buses are the top of the line.\r\n<b>5. Expand Your Business Across the Country</b>\ud83c\udf0e\r\nDon\u2019t just stop at one terminal. Expand your business to multiple locations. Manage terminals in different cities, optimize parking, and connect your empire from coast to coast.\r\n\r\nTerminal Master-Bus Tycoon provides a fun and engaging way to experience the challenges and rewards of managing a transportation business. Whether you\u2019re dealing with the daily operations, upgrading your fleet, or expanding your empire, this game offers a unique and addictive experience that keeps you coming back for more.\r\n\r\nSo, what are you waiting for? Download Terminal Master-Bus Tycoon now and start building your transportation empire today! Serve the people, manage your business, and become the ultimate terminal master. With awesome adventures and endless opportunities for growth, this game is perfect for anyone looking for a new and exciting idle game experience.",
